    {
      "bbox": [
        444,
        807,
        1775,
        1239
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Staggered Work Hours Program has also reduced waiting times and eased congestion in elevator operations. Studies conducted in three lower Manhattan buildings\u2014the headquarters of Chase Manhattan, Federal Reserve, and Morgan Guaranty Trust Banks\u2014showed substantial improvements.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.3057,
          "min": -1.7753
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 48,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0179
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10582,
        "area_px": 577220,
        "density": 0.01833,
        "chars": 280,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 26.46
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        444,
        1239,
        1564,
        1721
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Passenger counts taken at one-minute intervals during the morning peak period in the main lobbies of the three banks showed that prior to Staggered Work Hours, employees waited for elevators for an average of more than 2\u00bd minutes during peak periods. After Staggered Work Hours began, this delay was reduced to about one minute.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2423,
          "min": -1.7933
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 68,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0024
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7708,
        "area_px": 541596,
        "density": 0.01423,
        "chars": 328,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 42.55
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        444,
        1727,
        1564,
        1975
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Here is a dramatic example of improvement. In the main lobby of one of the banks, before the new program began, there were 110 people waiting in the lobby for elevator service.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2515,
          "min": -1.6975
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0092,
          "min": -0.3516
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3419,
        "area_px": 279750,
        "density": 0.01222,
        "chars": 176,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 51.48
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        647,
        1972,
        1931,
        2221
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "at a peak one-minute period just before 9 A.M. After Staggered Work Hours were introduced, the maximum number of passengers waiting during any one-minute period declined to 37 at 8:20 A.M.",
